      "faq": {
        "q_rolls": "Does it roll up when walking or sitting?",
        "a_rolls": "No. That's exactly why Nuvel exists. The girdle has a silicone band on the inner top edge that anchors it to your skin and keeps it in place even when you sit, bend, climb stairs or dance at a wedding. We tested different patterns and band heights for months until we found the combination that works on real bodies, not mannequins.",
        "q_size": "How do I choose the right size?",
        "a_size": "We use a guide based on your waist and hip measurements, not your usual clothing size (which varies a lot by brand). On the product page you'll find the full chart in centimeters. If you're between two sizes, choose the larger one: Nuvel compresses without squeezing, so it never rides up.",
        "q_visible": "Does it show under dresses and tight pants?",
        "a_visible": "No. The edges are laser-cut, with no raised seam and no fabric step. They're so thin they disappear under silk, crepe or any fitted fabric. It was the first requirement of the pattern: that a woman could put on a fitted dress without having to check it doesn't show before heading out.",
        "q_bathroom": "Can I use the bathroom without taking it off?",
        "a_bathroom": "The girdle has an opening where it's needed, designed so you can use the bathroom without undressing and putting it back on. That said, we always recommend checking it's sitting right when you're done.",
        "q_washing": "How many times can I wash it?",
        "a_washing": "No limit. The fabric is designed to keep its structure and compression after many washes. We recommend hand washing or a delicate cycle at 30°C, no spin, and air drying. Following this, the girdle keeps its shape.",
        "q_curvy": "Does it work if I have love handles?",
        "a_curvy": "Yes. We use progressive compression: layered, from softer to firmer, instead of squeezing everything equally and creating the classic bulge at the back and hips. The result is a smooth finish, not a roll marked at the fabric’s edge.",
        "q_heat": "Is it too warm? Does it breathe?",
        "a_heat": "The microfiber breathes and doesn't trap heat like girdles made from cheap synthetic fabrics. You can wear it in summer, even at 30°C at a wedding, without ending up drenched. That said, it's still a compression garment, not a dress.",
        "q_itchy": "Does it itch? Can I wear it all day?",
        "a_itchy": "The microfiber we use is certified and has no raised seams or stiff fabrics that chafe the skin. Designed for eight hours of continuous wear. The structure keeps its shape after dozens of washes.",
        "q_return": "What if I'm not convinced? Can I return it?",
        "a_return": "Yes. You have 30 days from receiving your order to return it, no explanation needed. Email us at hola@nuvelshape.store and we’ll arrange a home pickup, at no cost to you. Buying underwear online requires trust, and that trust has to go both ways.",
        "more_questions": "Can't find what you're looking for?"
